Description: enforce eMMC partition isolation and RPMB frame bounds
 Check regular reads, writes and erases against the selected partition instead
 of the USER area. Reject RPMB accesses through unauthenticated single-block
 and erase commands. Validate authenticated RPMB frame addresses and the full
 read block count before accessing storage so requests cannot expose or
 overwrite the adjacent USER area. Invalid writes preserve the write counter.
 Add protocol regressions for partition ends, multi-block overflow and RPMB
 command restrictions.
Forwarded: no

